# PAM stack for sshd in the PoC. pam_omni relays the conversation to the
# omni-enrollment daemon; it returns PAM_IGNORE for accounts it does not manage
# (root, omni-recovery) and when the daemon is down, so pam_unix — the
# break-glass path — is always reachable and is never bypassed for local users.
auth     sufficient pam_omni.so
auth     required   pam_unix.so nullok
account  sufficient pam_omni.so
account  required   pam_unix.so
session  required   pam_permit.so
session  optional   pam_mkhomedir.so
